+	// and security issues. Even crypto/rsa deprecated rsa.GenerateMultiPrimeKey as of Go 1.21.
+	// Given the above reasons, we only support what SCOSSL supports.
+	return primes == 2 && SupportsRSAPublicKey(bits)
